WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:04.856
One day a little mouse was wandering deep in the jungle.

2
00:00:04.857 --> 00:00:09.033
"Oh no!" she thought, looking around.

3
00:00:09.034 --> 00:00:11.449
"I think I'm lost!"

4
00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.591
The little mouse was tired and hungry.

5
00:00:14.592 --> 00:00:19.429
Sitting down to rest, she spotted something yellow in the grass.

6
00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:23.665
"Food!" she thought.

7
00:00:23.666 --> 00:00:27.869
She dashed over and bit into the yellow thing.

8
00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:30.693
But it was not food.

9
00:00:30.694 --> 00:00:36.366
It was a tail—the tail of a huge lion!

10
00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:39.442
"Ow!" The lion roared.

11
00:00:39.443 --> 00:00:43.111
"I am king of the jungle!

12
00:00:43.112 --> 00:00:47.016
Who dared to bite my tail?"

13
00:00:47.017 --> 00:00:49.713
The mouse trembled in fear.

14
00:00:49.714 --> 00:00:53.981
"I'm sorry, my king. I'm lost and hungry.

15
00:00:53.982 --> 00:00:58.807
I didn't realize it was your tail. Please forgive me!"

16
00:00:58.808 --> 00:01:03.123
The lion stared down at the tiny creature and laughed.

17
00:01:03.124 --> 00:01:07.084
" You bit my

18
00:01:07.085 --> 00:01:10.608
tail? Why, you're nothing but a little

19
00:01:10.609 --> 00:01:15.370
mouse!" He opened his jaws wide, ready to eat

20
00:01:15.371 --> 00:01:18.301
her. "Wait!" the mouse

21
00:01:18.302 --> 00:01:22.224
cried. "I am much too small to

22
00:01:22.225 --> 00:01:26.583
eat. Please let me go. And in return, I promise . .

23
00:01:26.584 --> 00:01:28.732
."

24
00:01:28.733 --> 00:01:34.831
"Yes?" The mouse thought fast. "I promise to help you

25
00:01:34.832 --> 00:01:40.050
someday." "Ha-ha!" The lion laughed again, this time harder than

26
00:01:40.051 --> 00:01:45.419
before. "You're just a tiny mouse—you can't help me.

27
00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:49.288
I am the king of this jungle.

28
00:01:49.289 --> 00:01:52.620
I do not need anyone's help.

29
00:01:52.621 --> 00:01:59.502
But since you made me laugh, I will let you go."

30
00:01:59.503 --> 00:02:02.728
"Thank you, my king. And you'll see.

31
00:02:02.729 --> 00:02:05.245
Someday I will help you!"

32
00:02:05.246 --> 00:02:15.961
The mouse ran off fast before the lion changed his mind.

33
00:02:15.962 --> 00:02:19.801
A few days later, the mouse was back in the jungle.

34
00:02:19.802 --> 00:02:22.351
She heard a familiar roar.

35
00:02:22.352 --> 00:02:25.237
"Oh my," the mouse thought.

36
00:02:25.238 --> 00:02:30.664
"That sounds like the lion. Is he in trouble?"

37
00:02:30.665 --> 00:02:33.763
She dashed toward the sound.

38
00:02:33.764 --> 00:02:39.532
Sure enough, there was the lion—trapped in a hunter's strong net!

39
00:02:39.533 --> 00:02:45.029
"My king, do not worry!" the mouse said. "I will help you!"

40
00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:52.402
"It's you again." The lion sighed.

41
00:02:52.403 --> 00:02:56.529
"How can you help a big lion like me?

42
00:02:56.530 --> 00:03:00.389
You're much too small to do anything."

43
00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:04.228
"Just watch," the mouse said.

44
00:03:04.229 --> 00:03:07.289
The mouse began chewing on the net.

45
00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:10.315
Soon she had made a big hole.

46
00:03:10.316 --> 00:03:13.903
The lion slipped right through it!

47
00:03:13.904 --> 00:03:18.919
The large king of the jungle bowed to the little mouse.

48
00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:22.623
"Thank you, Mouse," he said.

49
00:03:22.624 --> 00:03:26.868
"You kept your promise and saved my life.

50
00:03:26.869 --> 00:03:33.017
I'll never judge anyone by their size again."

